# Ruleset: Apple TV and News
#
# Expects a proxy policy, referenced with extended-matching. Must precede Platforms/Apple.list.
#
# The Apple services whose catalogs depend on the connection region are the TV app, with its channels and licensed streams, and News. Music and Podcasts are storefront bound rather than address bound, so they stay on the direct floor; a proxy path can block QUIC attempts to their playback hosts.

# Apple TV
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tv.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-amt.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,hls-svod.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,np-edge.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,ocvideo.apple.com
DOMAIN,uts-api.itunes.apple.com

# Apple News
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news
DOMAIN,news-assets.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-client-search.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-edge.apple.com
DOMAIN,news-events.apple.com
